	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Sospes domum redii, ubi omnia salva, deo gratia.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Silent omnia; tantum video paratos omnium <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>principum animos ad sustentandum <persName ref="p8616">Albertum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Brandeburgensem</persName>, ne prorsus opprimatur, quo nomine <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>conventum instituunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Adhuc pendet res, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nec possumus certo scire, habituri simus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>hac estate comitia <placeName ref="l18">Augustana</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ego valde <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>metuo, ne bono <persName>Colino</persName> imponatur; filius eius <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><persName>Theodorus</persName> famulum agit, tempus absumit et <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nihilominus cogetur 30 fl. numerare.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>At hoc non satis est; sed hospes eius illum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>onerat, quasi alibi tempus terat; sed hoc non ita <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>est.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nollem autem videri, ne hic incidam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>in turbas; sed caritas impulit, ut pauca <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>haec ad te.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quin audi, hospes eius superiori<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>bus diebus, quum <persName>Theodorum</persName> obiurgaret, vocavit <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eum haereticum, nempe ut <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinum</placeName>, proh <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>summe deus, hine homines se evangelicos esse <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>putant.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Libellus, qui tibi a <persName>Laurentio</persName> dabi<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tur, n<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>on est a me concinatus (auctus tamen), quod dico, ut <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>scias me non versaturum posthac in levi<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>culis illis argumentis, quamquam et illa excitant <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et ita excitant, ut <placeName ref="l18">Augustensis</placeName> magistratus mo<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nuerit bibliopolam, ne meos libros inferet a<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>mplius; sentit papatus se utcumque ex<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>agi<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tari a me et me non potest ferre et <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>maiora dolebit (ut spero).</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8296">Bassafontaneus</persName> me <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>honorifice suscepit, ita ut neque indonatum dimi<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>serit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">"Accipe", inquit, "pro viatico munusculum, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>quia video te multa impendere", et dedit 30 coronatos.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Utinam, quum ad eum scripseris, opportune <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>verbum addas dicasque "<persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName> tuam liber<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>alitatem mihi deprędicat."</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Cogito mihi <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>bibliothecam brevi instituere, quandoquidem <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>video patrem coelestem mihi non deesse.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Interim rogo deum, ut urgeat te et <persName ref="p8011">Gvalterum</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ita ut cogamini ad <placeName>Ferinas Thermas</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">O uti<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nam; addam me socium, etiamsi non egroto.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Vale, frater, ora pro me.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvere iubeo <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>totam familiam.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l512">Tubingae</placeName> 15. <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>iunii 1554.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/><persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Das Folgende ("In libello... quiesco") steht auf einem Zettel, der auf p. 623 aufgeklebt ist. <persName>Simler</persName> (Ms S 74, 184) sieht darin (irrtümlich) eine Nachschrift zu Vergerio an HB, 23. April 1551.]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>In libello, qui tibi a <placeName ref="l104">Cremonensi</placeName> dabitur, id erit in tota <lb xml:id="p2z15"/><placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> perridiculum; nam notus est passim <persName>Gerardus <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Busdragus</persName> inquisitor et persecutor omnium peximus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Huic ergo ego librum adscripsi; nam talis est, <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>qui melius loqui non potest.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Sed vide tu saltem <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>lectionem ultimam, in qua multa de <persName ref="p18531">Iulio III.</persName> an<lb xml:id="p2z20"/>tichristo, et patere aequo animo, oro te, <persName ref="p495">Henrice <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Bullingere</persName>, ut exagitem illos diabolos saltem aliquando, <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>quum a gravioribus studiis quiesco<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Vor 616 von anderer Hand:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, pastori <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>fratri honorando.</s>
